      "judgment": "not_useful",
      "rationale": "Column formatting deduplicates assignments, renders callees specially and uses nested joins. Type-list formatting renders type items with a comma separator. A common map/collect/join wrapper would move each meaningful policy into callbacks without replacing a shared semantic operation.",
